      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start, very professional. Could you make it sound a little more \"human\" though? Like, maybe acknowledge that mistakes like this can feel a bit chaotic or unpredictable, almost like something went wrong behind the scenes that was totally out of our control. Just a touch more personality so she doesn't feel like she's talking to a robot.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
