    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Actually, looking at it again, \"logistical snag\" feels a bit too corporate. Can we lean into that idea of it being \"unpredictable\" or \"chaotic\" a bit more? Like, maybe suggest that sometimes things just go rogue in a warehouse and it's hard to track down exactly where the mischief happened. Just a subtle way to make the brand feel more relatable and less like a machine.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
