      "content": "Subject: A Sincere Apology Regarding Your Midnight Recovery Serum Order - Order #[Insert Order Number]\n\nDear Mrs. Gable,\n\nPlease accept my deepest apologies for the hold-up with your Midnight Recovery Serum. I know how annoying it is when things get derailed, and I want to be transparent: sometimes, things just go a little rogue in the warehouse, and we've had an unpredictable sorting error in Memphis. To make things right, we are immediately processing a full refund for your shipping costs.\n\nWe truly value you as a customer, and we're working hard to ensure this little chaos doesn't happen again. We hope you can accept our apology while your serum makes its way to you soon.\n\nSincerely,\n\n[Your Name]\nOperations Manager, Lumière",
      "source": "target",
